mamesession.py scripts (Minix tree src/rosco/tools) for the SD card that
tools/mamebench.py builds in build/mame.  Run, from build/mame:

  podman run --rm --userns=keep-id -e SDL_VIDEODRIVER=dummy -v $PWD:/work \
    -v $MINIX/src/rosco/tools:/tools:ro --entrypoint python3 \
    localhost/rosco-emulator /tools/mamesession.py /opt/rosco \
    /work/rosco_sd.bin /work/out.log /work/shell1.txt

shell1.txt  * commands and OSCLI from BASIC (console and piped stdin)
shell2.txt  an interactive *sh subshell, then INPUT in BASIC
